      <bbox x="18159.9" y="4594.8" w="24.0" h="24.0" />
    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00197" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00197</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein deactivation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Collectively, our results suggest that, during potyvirus infection, HCPro acts together with other viral proteins to inhibit SAM synthesis, one of the most critical steps in the methionine cycle. [...] In potyvirus-infected cells, HCPro acts together with other viral proteins to locally inhibit SAMS and SAHH. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#rx00197">
              <bqbiol:is>
                <rdf:Bag>
