      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00358</html:p>
          <html:p>type: degradation/secretion</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Cytokinin oxidases/dehydrogenases (CKX) catalyze the irreversible degradation of the cytokinins isopentenyladenine, zeatin, and their ribosides in a single enzymatic step by oxidative side chain cleavage. </html:p>
        </html:body>
