          <html:p>reaction: rx00448</html:p>
          <html:p>type: catalysis</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Conversion to MeIAA, likely    by    IAA    CARBOXYMETHYLTRANSFERASE1    (IAMT1)  in  Arabidopsis  (Zubieta et  al.,  2003; Qin et  al., 2005),  results  in  a  non-polar  modified  auxin  that  is  proba-bly capable of  transporter-independent movement (Li et al., 2008; Yang et al., 2008).</html:p>
