    <glyph class="process" id="rx00449" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00449</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein activation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: RBOHD, where the synthetic peptide GILRGANS(p)DT(p)NSDTESI was phosphorylated by DORN1-KD in the KiC assay; we verified the DORN1–RBOHD interaction by Co-IP assays in wild-type protoplasts, where a HA-tagged DORN1 was co-expressed with a Myc-tagged RBOHD either with or without the addition of ATP; we incubated N-terminal, recombinant RBOHD protein with the purified DORN1 kinase domain and assayed for phosphorylation by radiolabeling with 32P-ATP. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
