      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00450</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Gene expression, VIGS, and ChIP analysis led to the identification of direct target genes of ORA59, ERF1, ROF2/FKBP65, UTR1, BGLU30/DIN2 as ACC-responsive genes, and CYP81F4, DR4, and ERF016 as MeJA-responsive genes.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
