    <glyph class="process" id="rx00507" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00507</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: we have shown that MYC2 binds to the promoter of several important defense regulators, including PEPR1, MKK4, RIN4, and the second intron of ICS1. MYC2 positively regulates the expression of RIN4, MKK4, and ICS1; however, it negatively regulates the expression of PEPR1.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
