      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00521</html:p>
          <html:p>type: binding/oligomerisation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: we resolved the structure of VPg, revealing a previously unknown 3-dimensional (3D) fold, and characterized the VPg–eIF4E complex using NMR and biophysical techniques</html:p>
