      <port id="rx00536.in" x="11872.7" y="3464.5" />
      <port id="rx00536.out" x="11872.7" y="3514.5" />
    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00537" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00537</html:p>
          <html:p>type: translocation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Whether benzoyl-CoA is ultimately exported from the peroxisome or is acted upon by a thioesterase to produce BA for export is unknown, although it is generally argued that CoA esters are not exported, since this could deplete the peroxisomal pools of CoA</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#rx00537">
