      <bbox x="15010.9" y="1830.1" w="24.0" h="24.0" />
    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00577" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00577</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Intriguingly,OE5-6showed selective up-regulation of HSP18.1-CI and HSP26.5-MII expression, in addition to APX2 (Supplemental Figs. S8, B and C, and S9). The results confirmed that ABA-mediated HSFA6b expression is required for proper stress-related gene expression under both salt and ABA treatments.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:sio="http://semanticscience.org/resource/">
