    <glyph class="process" id="rx00579" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00579</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: In HSFA3-defective protoplasts, HSFA6b overexpression significantly activated the transcription of HSP18.1-CI and APX2 promoters (Fig. 7D; Supplemental Fig. S10B), and HSFA3 coexpression had an additive effect on their expression. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
