      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00580</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein deactivation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Here, we demonstrated that recombinant Zucchini yellow mosaic virus (ZYMV) HC-Pro inhibited the methyltransferase activity of HEN1 in vitro</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
