          <html:p>reaction: rx00596</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: translation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Our findings demonstrate that in addition to the components involved in dicing and slicing, the RNA silencing antiviral defense in plants requires an essential RDR function to amplify viral siRNAs by either RDR1 or RDR6.</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
