    <glyph class="process" id="rx00615" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00615</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein activation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: The submergence of plant tissues impedes cellular access to O2 and CO2 , which can severely disrupt metabolism</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
