          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: High temperatures promote the reversion of phyB back to its inactive state, leaving PIF4 and PIF7 free to transcribe thermomorphogenesis promoting genes</html:p>
