          <html:p>evidence: The results (Table 1) showed that VPg proteins of PSbMV, LMV, and TuMV, but not TEV, interacted with products of At5g48160 and At3g07780 (named PVIP1 and PVIP2) and of PVIPp and PVIPnb.</html:p>
