          <html:p>reaction: rx00695</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein activation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: This group [Plant Phenolics] includes metabolites derived from the condensation of acetate units (e.g. terpenoids), those produced by the modification of aromatic amino acids (e.g. phenyl-propanoids; cinnamic acids, lignin precursors, hydroxybenzoic acids, catechols and coumarins),fiavanoids, isofiavanoids and tannins (dihydroxy-phenols and flavanols polymerized by the action of peroxidases and polyphenoloxidases).</html:p>
