      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00704</html:p>
          <html:p>type: binding/oligomerisation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Given the physical interaction between GI and PIFs through a region containing the bHLH domain, we hypothesized that GI could function to prevent the access of PIFs to their target promoters and/or affect their stability.</html:p>
