    <glyph class="process" id="rx00710" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00710</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: The ATAF1 mRNA accumulated within 2 h after drought treatment. The transcript was continuously elevated for up to 10 h. The result suggests that ATAF1 transcription is induced in response to osmotic stress.</html:p>
          <html:p>export notes: fix-form:protein-product-active</html:p>
        </html:body>
