          <html:p>reaction: rx00714</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: phosphorylation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: MKK1 and MKK2 are both involved in the enhancement of MPK4 activity by elicitor treatment | Arabidopsis MPK4 is activated under a variety of biotic and abiotic stress conditions, probably through the MEKK1, MKK1/MKK2 and MPK4 kinase cascade. </html:p>
        </html:body>
