    <glyph class="process" id="rx00776" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00776</html:p>
          <html:p>type: transcriptional/translational activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: transcription</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: ADR1, ADR-L1 and ADR-L2 encode three closely related CC-NB-LRR proteins required for immunity mediated by TIR-NB-LRR R proteins RPP2 and RPP4. They were also identified as candidate target genes of SARD1 by ChIP-seq (Table 1). ChIP-PCR analysis confirmed that SARD1 binds to the promoter regions of these three genes (Fig. 5d). </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
      <extension>
