    </glyph>
    <glyph class="process" id="rx00785" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx00785</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein deactivation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: conformational change</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: High temperatures promote condensation of ELF3, and the inhibition of ELF3-DNA binding. </html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
