          <html:p>type: binding/oligomerisation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: Furthermore, pull-down assays confirmed the direct association between recombinant GST-14-3-3k and MBP-CPK12-His in vitro (Figure 7C), indicating that CPK12 physically interacts with 14-3-3k in vivo and in vitro.</html:p>
