          <html:p>evidence: NPR1- and sim3-dependent ubiquitination of WRKY70 by the NPR1-CUL3 E3 ubiquitin ligase reconstituted in E. coli. FLAG-WRKY70 was immunoprecipitated under dn conditions.</html:p>
