    <glyph class="process" id="rx01012" orientation="vertical">
      <notes>
        <html:body>
          <html:p>reaction: rx01012</html:p>
          <html:p>type: protein activation</html:p>
          <html:p>mechanism: phosphorylation</html:p>
          <html:p>evidence: CPK6 and CPK33 are responsible for the phosphorylation of FD T282 and complex formation via 14-3-3 with FT in the shoot apex to regulate flowering</html:p>
        </html:body>
      </notes>
